===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|/ˈkʌni/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|cunnies}}

# {{obsolete}} a [[cony]], [[rabbit]].
# {{context|vulgar slang|archaic}} a [[cunt]], [[vulva]].
